WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.412
Danny: This place is boring.

2
00:00:15.413 --> 00:00:17.477
Brad: It's school, Danny.

3
00:00:17.478 --> 00:00:19.247
Brad: We have to go.

4
00:00:19.248 --> 00:00:22.337
Tina: Yes. It's nice to be back.

5
00:00:22.338 --> 00:00:26.436
Danny: Remember what we were doing a week ago!

6
00:00:26.437 --> 00:00:29.344
Tina: Has it been only a week?

7
00:00:29.345 --> 00:00:33.044
Brad: It feels like a lifetime ago.

8
00:00:33.045 --> 00:00:37.623
Danny: Don't you want to go back to Ginormous?

9
00:00:37.624 --> 00:00:40.352
Tina: We already saved Ginormous.

10
00:00:40.353 --> 00:00:43.677
There's no reason to go back.

11
00:00:43.678 --> 00:00:46.431
Danny: We could have another adventure!

12
00:00:46.432 --> 00:00:49.241
Tina: We don't have any magic clay, Danny.

13
00:00:49.242 --> 00:00:59.161
Brad: She's right. And we have to go to school, anyway.

14
00:00:59.162 --> 00:01:02.376
Danny: I think Hopian would be happy to see us.

15
00:01:02.377 --> 00:01:06.139
Tina: Shh! Don't talk too loudly about our adventure.

16
00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:10.160
Brad: Yeah, no one would believe what we were saying.

17
00:01:10.161 --> 00:01:21.036
Mr. Smith: Children, please open your books to page fifty.

18
00:01:21.037 --> 00:01:23.769
Brad: Danny, why don't you play with me?

19
00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:27.388
Danny: Are you attacking evil giants on your computer?

20
00:01:27.389 --> 00:01:29.716
Brad: No. It's a new math program.

21
00:01:29.717 --> 00:01:31.739
I can calculate─

22
00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:39.431
Danny: I'm not interested!

23
00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:44.560
Chuck: Ha. Your girlfriend is not playing with you anymore!

24
00:01:44.561 --> 00:01:46.986
Danny: She's not my girlfriend!

25
00:01:46.987 --> 00:01:48.879
Dave: He loves her!

26
00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:54.801
Brad: Listen, just leave us alone.

27
00:01:54.802 --> 00:01:57.651
Chuck: We could hurt you really bad.

28
00:01:57.652 --> 00:01:58.922
Danny: Don't try it.

29
00:01:58.923 --> 00:02:02.962
I've got a friend, a really big friend─

30
00:02:02.963 --> 00:02:05.964
Brad: Danny! Don't say any more!

31
00:02:05.965 --> 00:02:12.002
Dave: No. I want to hear about your big friend.

32
00:02:12.003 --> 00:02:13.965
Tina: Will you two go away?

33
00:02:13.966 --> 00:02:16.511
Danny: Tina, I don't need your help.

34
00:02:16.512 --> 00:02:19.225
I'll get Hopian to punish them!

35
00:02:19.226 --> 00:02:20.359
Chuck: Who?

36
00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:24.428
Dave: He must have another girlfriend!

37
00:02:24.429 --> 00:02:28.411
Dave: "Hopian." What a stupid name!

38
00:02:28.412 --> 00:02:35.788
Chuck: I thought it would be "Peaches" or "Lovey Dovey!" Hoo, hoo, hoo!

39
00:02:35.789 --> 00:02:38.512
Danny: You'll be sorry you teased me!

40
00:02:38.513 --> 00:02:45.651
Dave: You can't hurt us. See ya, loser!

41
00:02:45.652 --> 00:02:49.097
Tina: Danny, we promised each other not to mention Hopian.

42
00:02:49.098 --> 00:02:51.534
Danny: Chuck and Dave are bullies!

43
00:02:51.535 --> 00:02:54.213
I wanted to scare them.

44
00:02:54.214 --> 00:02:57.016
Brad: I don't think that's a good idea.

45
00:02:57.017 --> 00:03:00.599
Danny: You're as dull as our teachers, Brad.

46
00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.281
Brad: I'm just cautious.

47
00:03:03.282 --> 00:03:07.932
Danny: You weren't cautious when we were trying to save Ginormous!

48
00:03:07.933 --> 00:03:09.620
Brad: We're back home now.

49
00:03:09.621 --> 00:03:13.241
Things are different.

50
00:03:13.242 --> 00:03:14.947
Danny: I don't care.

51
00:03:14.948 --> 00:03:20.406
I think everyone should know what we did.

52
00:03:20.407 --> 00:03:22.100
Tina: What is he doing?

53
00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:24.686
He hates soccer.

54
00:03:24.687 --> 00:03:28.118
Soccer player: Hey, you can't use your hands!

55
00:03:28.119 --> 00:03:33.592
Brad: I've got a bad feeling about this.
